### Test Progress Retrieval Endpoints (Task 35)
### These endpoints allow retrieving lesson progress data

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@lessonId = LESSON_UUID_HERE
@courseId = COURSE_UUID_HERE
@studentId = STUDENT_UUID_HERE

### 1. Get single lesson progress for current user
### GET /lessons/:lessonId/progress
### Returns progress status, position, watched duration, completion status
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/progress
Authorization: {{token}}

###

### 2. Get all lesson progress in a course for current user
### GET /courses/:courseId/progress
### Returns all lessons with progress status, ordered by display order
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/progress
Authorization: {{token}}

###

### 3. Get all progress for a specific student
### GET /students/:studentId/progress
### Returns all course enrollments with lesson progress
### Students can only view their own; admins can view any student
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/progress
Authorization: {{token}}

###

